[needed on 3.38.3 arm64 host]
meta-flutter repo patch backporting upstream master PR #747 : 
	'patch DEPS condition for JDK download on aarch64 cross-compile builds'

with flutter 3.38.3, this is necessary to build flutter-engine on arm64 host, which by
default will try & fail to unconditionally fetch openjdk for arm64 (this openjdk config doesn't exist)
this should already be fixed on meta-flutter master (and in the upstream google flutter)

